Gesso is a modified version of ArtCraft (https://github.com/storytold/artcraft) by the ArtCraft
Team. It is not made, endorsed, sponsored or supported by the ArtCraft Team.

Changes from ArtCraft (see the git history for every change):
  - The desktop app (artcraft-native, now gesso/) was renamed Gesso, with its own name, app id,
    icon and mark (gesso/assets/brand/, original artwork, MIT OR Apache-2.0).
  - Local mode was added: generation on the user's own Google Cloud Vertex AI and AWS Bedrock
    accounts, model routing with TypeSafe Jev, spend metering and cost estimates, the studio tools
    (image and video editing, background removal, frame extraction, 3D Stage, audio) and
    hand-offs to the Craft apps (gesso/src/backend/local/, gesso/src/pages/tools/ and the files
    that call them).
  - ArtCraft's Tauri desktop app (crates/desktop/artcraft/), its web frontend (frontend/), their
    build scripts and release workflows were removed. With them went every ArtCraft logo and icon,
    and the third-party files ArtCraft's NOTICE lists as not licensed (sound effects, meme images,
    skybox textures, MMD motion data and Mixamo renders).

